<title>UK: Natwest hikes UK base rate to 6.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Natwest hikes UK base rate to 6.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Westminster Bank plc said on Thursday it was raising its UK base lending rate to 6.75 percent from 6.50 percent in line with a similar hike from the Bank of England of its money market dealing rates.</p>
</text>
